[00:00.000]...
[00:13.636]It only takes one lone soul
{"只需一个孤独的灵魂"}
[00:17.275]It only takes one in a thousand
{"千里挑一便已足够"}
[00:20.823]The absence of fear in your eyes
{"你眼中毫无畏惧"}
[00:25.338]No, that's not bravery
{"不 那并非勇敢"}
[00:28.307]As children we learn it's wrong
{"儿时我们便知熄灭他人光芒是错"}
[00:31.728]to put out the light of another
{"熄灭他人的光芒"}
[00:35.412]Our innocence lost over time
{"天真随时间消逝"}
[00:39.893]Means to an end
{"达成目的的手段"}
[00:43.785]It's hard to hold
{"难以昂首挺胸"}
[00:45.070]your head up high
{"高昂你的头颅"}
[00:46.944]But we must try
{"但我们必须尝试"}
[00:50.585]Sway together in the dark
{"在黑暗中共同摇曳"}
[00:54.277]It's supposed to be
{"这本该如此"}
[00:57.778]'Cos I want to know the end
{"因我想知晓结局"}
[01:01.029]and you never ever need to fight
{"而你永远无需战斗"}
[01:05.064]But you're fighting everyday
{"可你每天都在抗争"}
[01:08.170]And I don't know
{"我无从知晓"}
[01:09.948]when your light will go out
{"你的光芒何时熄灭"}
[01:12.711]Innocent crying child
{"无辜哭泣的孩子"}
[01:16.048]The heart of your enemy
{"敌人心中的柔软"}
[01:19.330]My heart to heart with the light
{"我与光芒心心相印"}
[01:23.187]and we always get along
{"我们总能和睦相处"}
[01:26.528]Counting the stars in the sky
{"细数夜空的星辰"}
[01:30.542]thinking why they have to die
{"思索它们为何陨落"}
[01:33.522]Just face to face we can hear
{"只需面对面 我们就能听见"}
[01:37.683]a voice telling us it's wrong
{"有个声音告诉我们这是错的"}
[01:40.982]Counting the stars in the sky
{"细数夜空中的繁星"}
[01:44.968]It was like a lullaby
{"它宛如一首摇篮曲"}
[01:49.435]...
[02:02.655]For sunsets I'll break the rules
{"为黄昏我愿打破规则"}
[02:06.301]We learnt playing down
{"我们学会低调行事"}
[02:08.228]in the heather
{"在石楠丛中"}
[02:09.997]The secrets behind all the veils
{"揭开所有面纱后的秘密"}
[02:14.180]We just use other words
{"我们只是换种说法"}
[02:17.300]For freedom we make our charge
{"为自由我们发起冲锋"}
[02:20.814]For friendship we bear
{"为友谊我们承受"}
[02:22.659]down on others
{"他人的打压"}
[02:24.571]Can't one of you just calculate
{"难道你们没人能推算出"}
[02:29.119]Tranquility?
{"宁静吗？"}
[02:32.489]It's hard to hold
{"很难保持"}
[02:34.250]your head up high
{"高昂的头颅"}
[02:36.017]But we must try
{"但我们必须尝试"}
[02:39.641]Sway together in the dark
{"在黑暗中共同摇曳"}
[02:43.314]It's supposed to be
{"这本该是"}
[02:46.897]'Cos I want to know the end
{"因我想知道结局"}
[02:49.855]and you never ever need to fight
{"而你永远不必争斗"}
[02:54.242]But you're fighting everyday
{"但你每天都在抗争"}
[02:57.137]And I don't know
{"而我无从知晓"}
[02:58.982]when your light will go out
{"你的光芒何时熄灭"}
[03:02.117]Innocent crying child
{"天真哭泣的孩子"}
[03:05.109]The heart of your enemy
{"你敌人的心脏"}
